; ===== 2026-11-21 additions =====
; A second poster is refused while one bounty is already carried.
ui.hint.busy=You are already carrying a bounty. Finish it first.
; Target marker: prefix / name / distance. Leave the prefix empty to drop it.
ui.target.wanted=WANTED
ui.target.distance=%dm
; A dead-or-alive poster prints both prices.
ui.poster.alive=ALIVE
ui.poster.dead=DEAD
; Reading the case file again while the bounty runs.
ui.hint.review=Press F7 to read the case file at any time.
ui.prompt.review=Read case file
ui.prompt.close=Close

